Results/weights/calib_test_*/

# NOTE: Results/metrics/.mc_sweep_checkpoints/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
# It holds in-progress-point resume state (banked eval reps, training minibatch
# index) for run_mc_sweep.py. That was local-only while points finished in
# minutes; they now take hours to days, so a single point can represent ~20h of
# compute that a container/disk loss would destroy. It is committed alongside
# the weights that produced it so a restart resumes from the last pushed state.
